        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Roof inspections in Utah are free when requested through most local roofing contractors, while hiring an independent, unbiased third-party home inspector typically costs $300 to $500 (often bundled into a full home purchase inspection) .",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "$300 to $500"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown by Inspector Type"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Roofing Contractors ($0): Most local roofing companies\u2014such as Ensign Roofing in Lehi or PRQ Exteriors in Bountiful\u2014offer complimentary, no-obligation roof inspections and estimates. Keep in mind that contractors often use these free inspections to pitch repairs or replacements.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              1,
              3,
              4
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Independent Home Inspectors ($300\u2013$500): If you need an objective report for a real estate transaction without sales pressure, hiring a licensed home inspector to check the roof (alongside the rest of the structure) usually ranges from $300 to $500 depending on the size of the home .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              2
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Average Cost of Related Utah Roof Services"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If an inspection uncovers issues that require attention, typical market rates in Utah run:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Minor repairs (sealing vents, minor flashing): $150 \u2013 $400"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Moderate repairs (shingle replacement after wind/hail): $400 \u2013 $1,200"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Roof rejuvenation treatments: $1,500 \u2013 $3,500"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Full asphalt shingle replacement: $10,000 \u2013 $21,000+ (depending on size and materials)",
            "reference_indexes": [
              4
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
